# Loads the flake devShell (just, opentofu, nixfmt, …). Requires a hooked direnv;
# otherwise run: nix develop
use flake

# nix-direnv auto-watches the flake inputs but not every file reachable through
# `import`. shell.nix carries the shellHook that reinstalls .git/hooks/pre-commit,
# so without this line a change to the hook body only lands after an unrelated
# flake eval invalidates the cache. Watch it explicitly.
watch_file shell.nix
